# XiangshanV3 (Kunminghu) is the first core in the study that arrives as a
# Chisel generator rather than as Verilog, so it needs a Scala build. All
# of it is dev-only for the same reason as the block above: it belongs to
# a study under test/, and a consumer of bazel-orfs must never resolve a
# Scala toolchain to build a flow.
#
# Nothing is vendored. Twelve http_archives -- XiangShan and the eleven
# repositories its build pulls in as submodules -- each pinned by commit
# and sha256, each with a small BUILD overlay in this repository. That is
